#: ../../source/use-cases/government-data-croatia.md:1
msgid "Government data (Croatia)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-cases/government-data-croatia.md:3
msgid ""
"The City of Zagreb used ODE to comply with open data standards and foster"
" a culture of data literacy across different city offices in Zagreb."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-cases/government-data-croatia.md:5
msgid ""
"ODE flagged inconsistencies (e.g., missing values, formatting errors) in "
"seconds, such as a public buildings dataset with 11 columns of unlabeled "
"energy metrics. The team was able to add critical context (e.g., data "
"owners, sourcing methods) directly in ODE’s metadata panel, aligning with"
" FAIR principles."
msgstr ""

